 "text": "Government | Coffey County, KS\nSkip To Main Content This website is AudioEye enabled and is being optimized for accessibility. To open the AudioEye Toolbar, press \"shift + =\". Some assistive technologies may require the use of a passthrough function before this keystroke. For more information, activate the button labeled \"Explore your accessibility options\".\nLoading\nSkip to Main Content\nCreate a Website Account - Manage notification subscriptions, save form progress and more.\nWebsite Sign In\nGovernment\nDepartments\nCommunity\nCounty Services\nHow Do I...\nSearch\nAgendas & Minutes\nAttorney\nBoards\nAirport Board\nApply for a Board Position\nBoard Of Zoning Appeals\nFire District Number 1 Board\nHospital Board of Trustees\nHousing Authority Board\nMental Wellness Board\nLibrary Board\nLocal Emergency Planning Committee\nPlanning Board\nTourism & Visitors Board\nCounty Clerk\nCounty Commissioners\nAnnual Budget\nResolutions\nRegister of Deeds\nTreasurer\nHome\nGovernment\nGovernment\n9\n1\n1\n2\nAgendas & Minutes\nAccess easily searchable meeting agendas and minutes for various boards, commissions, and committees.\nAttorney\nThe Coffey County Attorney's Office is primarily a criminal prosecution agency representing the citizens of Coffey County and the victims of crime.\nBoards\nDiscover the boards that drive your local government. Find agendas, member information, and other meeting details.\nCounty Clerk\nThe County Clerk is the official secretary of the County and of the Board of County Commissioners.\nCounty Commissioners\nThe Coffey County Board of Commissioners is a five-person elected body that has overall responsibility for county government, setting policy and performing executive and legislative functions.\nRegister of Deeds\nThe Register of Deeds office files and records documents that pertain to real estate.\nTreasurer\nThe County Treasurer is a public official responsible for collecting taxes and maintaining financial records for a county.\nAgendas & Minutes\nEmergency Notifications\nTax Information\nHealth Information\nCoffey County Lake\nDistrict Court\nGIS Mapping\nSheriff Department\n-->\nContact Us\n110 S. 6th Street\nBurlington, KS 66839-1789\nPhone: 620-364-2191\nConnect With Us\nFacebook\nInstagram\nYouTube\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nPhotos by Mike Hoag\nHelpful Links\nCalendar\nCounty Commission\nEmployment Opportunities\nSheriff's Office\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nSite Links\nHome\nSite Map\nContact Us\nAccessibility\nCopyright Notices\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nGovernment Websites by CivicPlus®\nLoading\nLoading\nDo Not Show Again\nClose\nClose ×\nOpens in new window\nPDF Download\nWord Download\nExcel Download\nPowerPoint Download\nDocument Download\nExplore your accessibility options",
